# TMG design system (authoritative)

Source: **`TMG Color palette.docx`** at repo root. Machine-readable copy: `content/config/design-tokens.json`. CSS: `src/styles/global.css` `@theme`.

## Colors

| Role | Name | Hex |
|------|------|-----|
| Primary | Indigo | `#4057a1` |
| Accent / buttons | Light Blue | `#abddf7` |
| Text | Charcoal | `#25283d` |
| Background white | White | `#ffffff` |
| Background light | Lavender Gray | `#f5f4fa` |
| Background dark | Midnight blue | `#17213c` |

Border color is not specified in the docx; use Charcoal at reduced opacity or tokens in `global.css`—do not invent a second palette.

## Fonts

- **Body** (paragraphs, lists, UI): **Lato** (Google Fonts)
- **Headings** (H1–H4): **Lora** (Google Fonts)

## Rules for agents

- Do **not** hard-code one-off hex values in components; use `@theme` / Tailwind `tmg-*` tokens.
- Do **not** replace Lato/Lora without an explicit user request and docx update.
- Older pilot colors (teal/coral from legacy `pilot-site`) are **deprecated** unless the user says otherwise.
